{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A list of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers is formed by beginning with two given numbers.  Each new number in the list is the product of the two previous numbers.  Find the first number if the last three are shown:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/76215b8f7b52ed31b0c274ef270d019ed2fd160e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{\\underline{\\hspace{3 mm}?\\hspace{3 mm}}\\hspace{1 mm},\\hspace{1 mm} \\underline{\\hspace{7 mm}}\\hspace{1 mm},\\hspace{1 mm} \\underline{\\hspace{7 mm}}\\hspace{1 mm},\\hspace{1 mm} \\underline{\\hspace{7 mm}}\\hspace{1 mm},\\hspace{1 mm} \\underline{\\hspace{7 mm}}\\hspace{1 mm},\\hspace{1 mm}\\underline{\\hspace{2 mm}16\\hspace{2 mm}}\\hspace{1 mm},\\hspace{1 mm}\\underline{\\hspace{2 mm}64\\hspace{2 mm}}\\hspace{1 mm},\\hspace{1 mm}\\underline{\\hspace{1 mm}1024\\hspace{1 mm}}}\\]\" width=\"403\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/1091a649d40e12e3461cac691f01bfd1c916dbf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{64} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{4} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"350\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each missing term must be the quotient of the term two entries after it and the term immediately after it.  Therefore, the fifth term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the fourth term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the third is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the second is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the first is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/8/0b8c0715bbd6a8b0e49d6200b213e8eb6d823c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"60\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME\" title=\"1990 AJHSME\">1990 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1990 AJHSM